Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.83,generic sign style,,0,0,0,,Шошқа еті
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.83,generic sign style,,0,0,0,,Көкөністер
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.83,generic sign style,,0,0,0,,Жасыл бұрыш
